  "text": "A minotaur is a large humanoid with a bovine head and hooves. Though often mistaken for aggressive brutes, many minotaurs are skilled artisans. Lone minotaurs tend to make their lairs within a maze or old ruin, hunting anyone who dares to invade their labyrinthine home."
